  m_Name: Alpha v0.4.0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  versionName: Alpha v0.4.0
  logcontent: '<b><size=120%>Added:</size></b>

    <size=85%>- Active Capsule Loadout
    System: Customize and equip ability capsules in the Main Menu

    - Dedicated
    Capsule Skill action bound to Q key with HUD cooldown display

    - New Flying
    Enemy archetype with hover locomotion and player tracking

    - Dynamic Enemy
    Mutations (Damage, Slowness, Weakness, Stun) with distinct visual colors

    -
    Magic Aura Amulet: Reduces ability cooldowns

    - Experience bar HUD labels
    with Level and numerical XP tracking

    - Interactive selection highlighting
    on upgrade cards</size>


    <b><size=120%>Changed:</size></b>

    <size=85%>-
    Automatic reload when attempting to shoot with empty magazine

    - Vivid
    red floating damage numbers on landing Critical Hits

    - Standardized capsule
    cooldowns and updated skill descriptions

    - Enemy spawn rates and
    difficulty curves adjusted over match duration</size>'
